---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="Privacy Policy"
	description="Read the Thinker Scripts privacy policy, including how the site handles basic technical data, contact messages, cookies, and external links."
	keywords={[
		'Thinker Scripts privacy policy',
		'privacy policy',
		'website privacy',
		'data collection policy',
	]}
>
	<section class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-5 py-14 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
		<p class="font-mono text-xs text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-400">PRIVACY POLICY</p>
		<h1 class="mt-4 max-w-4xl text-5xl font-semibold leading-none text-pretty text-neutral-950 sm:text-7xl dark:text-white">
			Privacy Policy.
		</h1>
		<p class="mt-6 max-w-3xl text-lg leading-8 text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-300">
			This policy explains how Thinker Scripts handles information related to site visits, correspondence, and third-party services. Last updated June 6, 2026.
		</p>
	</section>

	<section class="border-y border-neutral-200 bg-neutral-50 py-14 dark:border-neutral-800 dark:bg-neutral-950">
		<div class="mx-auto grid max-w-4xl gap-8 px-5 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
			<div>
				<h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-neutral-950 dark:text-white">Information We Collect</h2>
				<p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-300">
					Thinker Scripts may receive basic technical information that browsers and hosting providers commonly process, such as pages visited, device type, browser type, approximate location, and referral source. If you contact us by email, we receive the information you choose to provide.
				</p>
			</div>
			<div>
				<h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-neutral-950 dark:text-white">How We Use Information</h2>
				<p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-300">
					We use information to operate the website, understand aggregate readership patterns, respond to inquiries, correct publication issues, and protect the site from abuse.
				</p>
			</div>
			<div>
				<h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-neutral-950 dark:text-white">Cookies and External Links</h2>
				<p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-300">
					The site may use essential browser storage for interface preferences such as theme settings. Articles may link to external websites that operate under their own privacy practices.
				</p>
			</div>
			<div>
				<h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-neutral-950 dark:text-white">Contact</h2>
				<p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-300">
					Questions about this policy can be sent to <a class="underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-neutral-950 dark:hover:text-white" href="mailto:hello@thinkerscripts.com">hello@thinkerscripts.com</a>.
				</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>
</Layout>
